{"output":"I’ll inspect project authorization and list caching, fix the isolation issues, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject reads and updates lack a membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates invalidate only a detail key. The eight existing tests pass but do not cover these bugs. I’ll fix those paths and add regression tests for revoked membership, list variants, and organization IDs with shared prefixes or punctuation.\n\nFixed ownership membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests. git diff --check passed. Exit code 0; no blockers.","final_output":"Fixed ownership membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests. git diff --check passed. Exit code 0; no blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":28,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/tenant-cache-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":376,"stdout_bytes":133,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-23f74fba182512a4cbd6b3f418f3f14d.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"s